  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut beetroot into bite-sized chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c60b2a879ceb8760ddc63/step-4c7363e7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with pepper. Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c60b2a879ceb8760ddc63/step-01362a89.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. Place in a medium bowl and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c60b2a879ceb8760ddc63/step-d6f6978a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry. Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi in batches until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Return all haloumi to the pan.\n• Reduce to medium heat, in the last minute of cook time, add garlic, honey and chilli flakes (if using!) and turn haloumi to coat, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c60b2a879ceb8760ddc63/step-2b1fc6f5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with the roasted veggies, add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar.\n• Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c60b2a879ceb8760ddc63/step-007baa41.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop roasted almonds.\n• Divide roast veggie toss between plates. Top with sweet and sticky haloumi.\n• Sprinkle with almonds. Serve with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c60b2a879ceb8760ddc63/step-7fe77852.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
